{"title":"$13 Wednesday Night 8:30 PM - 12 AM@ CA Badminton ","startsAt":"2026-10-21T20:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-22T00:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"⚠️The group's administrators do not participate in Wednesday evening activities. If you have any questions, please register and then go directly to the stadium to ask the person in charge.\n\nPromotion Cost $ 13\n\n\\* Included Feather birdies, please pay before joining the event.\n(Cash only) ---Cash only----Cash only\n\nLocation: 1370 Birchmount Rd, Unit 6\n\\*The close intersection in Birchmount Rd & Lawrence Ave.\n\nTime: 8:30 PM to 12:00 AM, 2-4 courts available\n\n* (Courts will be arranged according to the number of participants)\n* Please bring your own racket.\n* Please wear indoor sports shoes. (Shoes can be changed at the club.)\n* This weekly gathering is for intermediate to advanced badminton enthusiasts.\n* No outside food allowed.\n* This event is for friendly doubles matches and is open to all intermediate and advanced badminton enthusiasts. Please do not use this event for training or singles matches.\n* Please notify us of cancellations at least 24 hours in advance to allow other participants time to react. Latecomers or those who do not attend may be permanently removed from the group and will not be able to rejoin.","venue":{"name":"CA Badminton Academy","address":"1370 Birchmount rd, unit 6, Scarborough","lat":43.749893,"lng":-79.286789,"city":"Scarborough"},"fee":null,"group":"CA Badminton Meetup Toronto Group GTA","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/9/9/7/highres_507254743.jpeg"}